{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "expiring-approval",
  "family": "approval-timeout",
  "requirements": [
    "Protocol: each probe starts a fresh process; state persists only between its input lines. Read one JSON object per line and emit exactly one JSON object per line, with no other stdout. Object key order is immaterial; arrays are ordered. Inputs use exactly the documented keys; missing/extra keys, unknown operations, wrong types, null, booleans in integer positions and out-of-range values return {\"error\":\"invalid_input\"} without mutation, before any state-dependent checks. All quantities and logical times are integers; no wall clock, randomness, network or floating point is involved. Each followup applies independently to the base, never cumulatively. Followup rules override only the explicitly named base behavior.",
    "Start phase=idle, now=0, deadline=null. Every success returns exactly {phase,now,deadline}. status takes only op.",
    "request takes op and ttl (integer 1..1000); only idle may request, setting phase=pending and deadline=now+ttl; otherwise invalid_state. advance takes op and to (integer 0..1000000); to<now returns time_reversal, otherwise sets now=to and expires a pending request when now>=deadline. Expiry changes phase to expired, retaining deadline.",
    "decide takes op and approve (boolean); only pending permits it, changing phase to approved if true or rejected if false, retaining deadline. Other phases return invalid_state. Terminal decisions do not expire. Errors never mutate state; shape validation precedes state checks."
  ],
  "vocabulary": {
    "now": "Caller-controlled monotone logical tick.",
    "deadline": "First logical tick at which a pending decision is too late."
  },
  "probes": [
    {
      "id": "expiring-approval--approve-before",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "request",
          "ttl": 5
        },
        {
          "op": "advance",
          "to": 4
        },
        {
          "op": "decide",
          "approve": true
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "phase": "pending",
          "now": 0,
          "deadline": 5
        },
        {
          "phase": "pending",
          "now": 4,
          "deadline": 5
        },
        {
          "phase": "approved",
          "now": 4,
          "deadline": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "expiring-approval--exact-expiry",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "request",
          "ttl": 3
        },
        {
          "op": "advance",
          "to": 3
        },
        {
          "op": "decide",
          "approve": true
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "phase": "pending",
          "now": 0,
          "deadline": 3
        },
        {
          "phase": "expired",
          "now": 3,
          "deadline": 3
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_state"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "expiring-approval--rejection-persists",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "request",
          "ttl": 2
        },
        {
          "op": "decide",
          "approve": false
        },
        {
          "op": "advance",
          "to": 8
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "phase": "pending",
          "now": 0,
          "deadline": 2
        },
        {
          "phase": "rejected",
          "now": 0,
          "deadline": 2
        },
        {
          "phase": "rejected",
          "now": 8,
          "deadline": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "expiring-approval--logical-origin",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "advance",
          "to": 10
        },
        {
          "op": "request",
          "ttl": 4
        },
        {
          "op": "advance",
          "to": 9
        },
        {
          "op": "status"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "phase": "idle",
          "now": 10,
          "deadline": null
        },
        {
          "phase": "pending",
          "now": 10,
          "deadline": 14
        },
        {
          "error": "time_reversal"
        },
        {
          "phase": "pending",
          "now": 10,
          "deadline": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "expiring-approval--validation",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "decide",
          "approve": true
        },
        {
          "op": "request",
          "ttl": 0
        },
        {
          "op": "request",
          "ttl": 1
        },
        {
          "op": "request",
          "ttl": 2
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "invalid_state"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "phase": "pending",
          "now": 0,
          "deadline": 1
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_state"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "expiring-approval--protocol-rejections",
      "inputs": [
        {},
        {
          "op": "unknown"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "followups": [
    {
      "id": "expiring-approval--inclusive-deadline",
      "requirements": [
        "Expiry occurs only when now>deadline instead of now>=deadline. A pending decision at exactly deadline remains allowed."
      ],
      "probes": [
        {
          "id": "expiring-approval--inclusive-deadline--at-deadline",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "request",
              "ttl": 7
            },
            {
              "op": "advance",
              "to": 7
            },
            {
              "op": "decide",
              "approve": true
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "phase": "pending",
              "now": 0,
              "deadline": 7
            },
            {
              "phase": "pending",
              "now": 7,
              "deadline": 7
            },
            {
              "phase": "approved",
              "now": 7,
              "deadline": 7
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "expiring-approval--inclusive-deadline--after-deadline",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "request",
              "ttl": 6
            },
            {
              "op": "advance",
              "to": 7
            },
            {
              "op": "decide",
              "approve": false
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "phase": "pending",
              "now": 0,
              "deadline": 6
            },
            {
              "phase": "expired",
              "now": 7,
              "deadline": 6
            },
            {
              "error": "invalid_state"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "base_expected": {
        "expiring-approval--exact-expiry": [
          {
            "phase": "pending",
            "now": 0,
            "deadline": 3
          },
          {
            "phase": "pending",
            "now": 3,
            "deadline": 3
          },
          {
            "phase": "approved",
            "now": 3,
            "deadline": 3
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "expiring-approval--extend-once",
      "requirements": [
        "Add extend taking op and ttl (integer 1..1000). Only pending may extend; add ttl to the existing deadline and return status. Permit at most one successful extend per process; a second while pending returns already_extended. Check phase before already_extended. Other behavior is unchanged."
      ],
      "probes": [
        {
          "id": "expiring-approval--extend-once--extended-window",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "request",
              "ttl": 4
            },
            {
              "op": "extend",
              "ttl": 3
            },
            {
              "op": "advance",
              "to": 5
            },
            {
              "op": "decide",
              "approve": true
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "phase": "pending",
              "now": 0,
              "deadline": 4
            },
            {
              "phase": "pending",
              "now": 0,
              "deadline": 7
            },
            {
              "phase": "pending",
              "now": 5,
              "deadline": 7
            },
            {
              "phase": "approved",
              "now": 5,
              "deadline": 7
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "expiring-approval--extend-once--extension-guards",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "extend",
              "ttl": 1
            },
            {
              "op": "request",
              "ttl": 8
            },
            {
              "op": "extend",
              "ttl": 2
            },
            {
              "op": "extend",
              "ttl": 2
            },
            {
              "op": "advance",
              "to": 10
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "error": "invalid_state"
            },
            {
              "phase": "pending",
              "now": 0,
              "deadline": 8
            },
            {
              "phase": "pending",
              "now": 0,
              "deadline": 10
            },
            {
              "error": "already_extended"
            },
            {
              "phase": "expired",
              "now": 10,
              "deadline": 10
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
